{"id": "DeYWV4xT9iF", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Them: “Who is protecting you?”\n\nMe: “The one who holds the universe in her hands, yet holds me closest to her heart.” ❤️🔱\n\nNine divine forms. Nine shades of strength. One eternal Mother. 🌸\n\nFrom the gentleness of Shailputri to the fierce courage of Kalaratri, from the power that destroys darkness to the love that protects without being seen — Maa is everything. ✨\n\nIn every fear, she is my courage.\nIn every darkness, she is my light.\nIn every step, she walks beside me.\n\nनव रूप, एक ही ममता।\nहर रूप में शक्ति, हर रूप में माँ। ❤️\n\nजय माता दी! 🌺🙏\n\n#JaiMataDi #NavDurga #MaaDurga #Navratri #AdiShakti DivineFeminine SanatanDharma NineFormsOfDurga", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791778597, "like_count": 765, "comment_count": 3, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-4525946617732510a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 82.512, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNn1AvZfJcC5sMCtAq_QcIFR3CwTf558YQj8CG1vzVP6oT_HPrMtGcWwIcasYtT8le1MNj1fKlrI4UVg6hhpwtWQWQ2KpAOlCk7hLc.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdpdVzNqfgWuUnukFIXHwW8f54_LVm_UAxBTOEchAzCofVVHjs6ODaRy3br9TPHOwyBOLO3AARW-brqpK7cf7gkl&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=DLusWGX8_1kQ7kNvwE0eq0b&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=Gh65yn6vahma2FxJ4Yd5Iw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSdQW-Ue18bldhNSR4v8WL5zwzvRSIG-0MvSr_3iYA7tg&oe=6AF3FE1A", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 82.512, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/htm